{"id":3929,"date":"2020-11-01T16:03:48","date_gmt":"2020-11-01T16:03:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/?page_id=3929"},"modified":"2026-07-14T22:44:22","modified_gmt":"2026-07-14T22:44:22","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/en\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"\ube44\uc804\uacfc \uc0ac\uba85 &#8211; EN"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1584679614942{padding-top: 40px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8221;]<div class=\"grop-section_text   grop-heading-6ad190f09a36b   text-left\"><div class=\"text-uppercase grop-sctn_title_fntSz-30   grop-heading-6ad190f09a36b  text-left\">Love Toronto supports Korean-Canadian Community<\/div><p>Love Toronto is a non-profit organization established in March 2016 to support Korean immigrants settling in Canada by assisting any difficulties they may face. As of July 5, 2018, our organization was publicly registered as a charitable organization.<\/p><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row&#8221; content_placement=&#8221;middle&#8221; overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1584679092843{background-color: #f6f6f6 !important;}&#8221;][vc_column text_alignment=&#8221;text-center&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586291646200{padding-top: 60px !important;padding-bottom: 60px !important;}&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;2883&#8243; img_size=&#8221;60&#215;60&#8243; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1585171676249{padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;]<div class=\"grop-section_text   grop-heading-6ad190f09a3a1   vc_custom_1604246676397 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-uppercase grop-sctn_title_fntSz-30   grop-heading-6ad190f09a3a1  text-center\">Vision<\/h2><p>Love Toronto Korean-Canadian Community Services will be a network hub for Korean-Canadians in Toronto. We will dedicate ourselves to serve underprivileged community members with love, dignity, and respect.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"grop-section_text   grop-heading-6ad190f09a3b8   vc_custom_1604246738801 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-uppercase grop-sctn_title_fntSz-30   grop-heading-6ad190f09a3b8  text-center\">Mission<\/h2><p>Love Toronto is committed to providing practical help to Koreans residing in Canada for them to overcome numerous obstacles that may arise from cultural, language, social, or other barriers.<\/p><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row gap=&#8221;20&#8243; overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586887210760{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586887162266{padding-top: 0px !important;}&#8221; offset=&#8221;vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-6&#8243;][vc_column_text el_class=&#8221;grop-fix grop-about_txt&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3>Strategies and Duties<\/h3>\n<p>We commit to:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>providing relevant and accurate legal information booklets for community members.<\/li>\n<li>connecting clients facing legal issues with Korean-speaking lawyers to help find a solution.<\/li>\n<li>connecting clients to psychotherapeutic counseling services in Korean to help prevent, diagnose and treat issues related to mental health.<\/li>\n<li>cooperating with senior service organizations to provide different assistance and support programs for seniors.<\/li>\n<li>supporting to provide meal services for people in need, with the help of other churches and organizations.<\/li>\n<li>renting out Love Toronto\u2019s office space, either for free or for a minimal price, to those organizations that need a one-time venue or a frequently used office space.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column offset=&#8221;vc_col-lg-6 vc_col-md-6&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586887154789{padding-top: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text el_class=&#8221;grop-fix grop-about_txt&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3>Values<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><u>Respect<\/u>: We respect the dignity and sanctity of each individual and partner organizations.<\/li>\n<li><u>Integrity<\/u>: We believe every service and program, provided to clients, must be dealt with integrity; treating all clients with equity, equality and responsibility.<\/li>\n<li><u>Cooperation<\/u>: All internal and external organizations and departments must cooperate to provide the best service possible and to effectively perform organizational duties.<\/li>\n<li><u>Originality<\/u>: Our services and programs are original in providing tailored services for clients by analyzing the needs of the Korean-Canadian society.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row_content_no_spaces&#8221; overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1584737468633{background-image: url(https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/0.banner_donation.jpg?id=2698) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1584644856121{padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;background-color: rgba(10,10,10,0.4) !important;*background-color: rgb(10,10,10) !important;}&#8221;]<div class=\"grop-callout_area  grop-parlx-6ad190f09a3cb\"><div class=\"grop-vertical_middle  grop-fix grop-callout_container  \"><p><span style=\"font-size: 46px; line-height: 62px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'BMJUA';\">How to support Love Toronto<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #c3c3c3;\">Your donation will be a great help for our struggling Korean immigrants. Please join us in contributing to Korean society by donating through any of the available payments.<\/span><\/p>\n<div 